{
  "method": "Bounded interpretation of decoded htPf/hIs2 CIL control flow with explicit collection/property accessor stubs; no original DLL, GUI or generated app execution.",
  "boundaries": [
    "FromId/FromName/FirstOrDefault helpers are independently inspected static dependencies and represented by exact-match array lookup stubs here.",
    "Style.IsEmpty is modelled as zero properties in these cases, not claimed for all native style inheritance cases.",
    "OverriddenProps uses explicit supplied flags; no parent-style resolution is simulated.",
    "Exception/finally disposal has no mutation in these fixtures and is skipped by leave."
  ],
